# PostHog analytics (optional; docs/adr/0005). Without a key, no analytics code
# loads and nothing is sent. With one, the build allows PostHog's origin in the
# Content-Security-Policy's connect-src. Set it in Workers Builds, never here.
VITE_POSTHOG_KEY=
# VITE_POSTHOG_HOST=https://eu.i.posthog.com
